	(text "nPM1300 (QFN32). BUCK1 = +1V8 main rail (VSET1 47k). BUCK2 = +3V3_RF (VSET2 390k, on at power-up and\nkept on: SX1262 needs VBAT >= VBAT_IO at all times). SX1262 VBAT_IO = LR_VIO via LOADSW1 (LSIN1 = +1V8), off at\npower-on; FW: enable LOADSW1 only after boot, disable it before ship mode / BUCK2 off. LOADSW2 unused (to GND).\nCharger from VBUS (dock). NTC tied to GND -> disable NTC in BCHGDISABLESET. Buck accuracy is +-5% (PS 6.3.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
